aegis-shell (1.7.0-m8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The v0.6.20 captures called out four regressions; all four fixed.
  * Boot splash restored (W14): the 0200 hook deleted the initramfs
    plymouth integration after the script-theme black-screen era, so
    plymouth-start at 9.27 s never owned the display and every boot since
    flooded the frame with casper console text (boot-07/08 shipped the
    lines verbatim). The integration is back — the aegis-mark two-step
    theme (the same C-plugin chain as Ubuntu's own spinner) starts from
    init-premount, paints ink + mark + accent progress line, and the
    capture harness boots with console=tty1 so plymouth has a local
    console while the serial stays the diagnostics channel.
  * The splash assert is now real: the old "centre brightness" heuristic
    scored the 4 % console frame as consistent with the mark splash. The
    new signature check demands the ink background plus accent progress
    line or watermark pixels on a boot frame, else the boot test exits 1.
  * Do Not Disturb tile was dead on its body: the W13 wide-tile refactor
    left the full-tile MouseArea at visible: !wide, so only the 36x20
    switch responded — and the capture clicks the tile body, so five tags
    of DND-on captures are byte-identical to DND-off. The tile-wide
    MouseArea is back (declared first, switch keeps its own hit area),
    the bell is redrawn (dome + lip + clapper + nub, filled when DND is
    on), and the capture clicks the switch and asserts the frame moved.
  * The desktop-ready heuristic read five dock slots in the console text
    (boot-08 at val 13.7 passed as the desktop); readiness now also
    requires wallpaper-class brightness (val >= 30).
  * Top bar right cluster: the battery is always drawn (level fill when a
    battery pack is present, bolt when charging, bolt-only on AC-only
    machines like the boot-test VM), percentage beside it when known,
    danger tint at 20 % or less while discharging; Wi-Fi redrawn as a
    filled fan so the old stroked arcs stop reading thin. Tokens gains
    the danger color as the single source.

