aegis-shell (1.5.1-m2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * v0.4.3 code-review fixes (external review, three real bugs):
    - Dynamic Island hangs flush below the panel again — layershell margin
      30 double-counted the panel's 28 px exclusive zone (y = 58); now 2 px
      hairline gap. Idle mark PNG renders crisp via mipmap + sourceSize.
    - Dock magnification wave no longer freezes mid-motion: the field is
      refreshed every frame while hovered (pointer stationary but tiles
      sliding), and recompute() translates tray→row coordinates once
      (px -= row.x) so the wave is actually centered on the tiles.
    - Dock running dots ship visible: Util tracks launched commands
      (session-level; M3 swaps in real KWin window tracking) and the dot
      binds to isRunning(cmd) with a quick fade.
  * Small-macOS dock preset (user: "like macOS but in small size"):
    iconSize 64→48, tileWidth 76→58, tileHeight 86→68, trayRadius 28→22,
    trayPadding 12→10, magPeak 1.9→1.85, magFalloff 2.6→2.4,
    magStrength 0.9→0.85 — tray ≈62% of a 1280 px screen (was ≈95%).
